{"overview":"آلیا آلبورا همراه جسد شوهرش و پسر پنج ساله‌اش از کانادا به ماردین می‌آید تا به وصیت شوهرش عمل کند. با این حال این آمدن، رفتنی ندارد و راه خروجی از آلبورا وجود ندارد. جهان آلبورا که رئيس طایفه آلبوراست، با این که نسبت به ناراحتی آلیا بی‌توجهی نمی‌کند ولی اجازه نمی‌دهد فرزندش را بردارد و از آنجا برود. آلیا آلبورا که با تاریکی گذشته، رازهای پنهان و حقیقت منطقه روبرو می شود، به یکباره چشم باز می‌کند و خود را درون کشمکش بزرگی با خانواده شوهرش می بیند…","tagline":"","overview_en":"Alya Albora arrives in Mardin with her late husband’s funeral and their five-year-old son to fulfill her husband’s last will. However, this arrival marks a point of no return, and there is no way out of Albora. The head of the Albora tribe, Cihan Albora, is not indifferent to Alya’s struggles, but he refuses to let her take her child and leave. Confronting the darkness of the past, hidden secrets, and the harsh realities of the region, Alya Albora finds herself caught in a fierce struggle with her late husband’s family.","tagline_en":"","runtime":140,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":28,"y":2024,"poster":"/5LfeH1XrZDR3RBNer9eKRV6Ue3V.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":35,"y":2025,"poster":"/lnpbBuBqKJMGh68sNEWE5tLDl8U.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":35,"y":2026,"poster":"/7s7WpXmlmttGmdOBPuSNTpPgjfA.jpg"}],"episodes":98,"crew":["Ahmet Katıksız","Emre Aybek","Yıldız Aşanboğa","Gülizar Irmak"],"countries":["TR"],"cast":[{"name":"اوزان آکبابا","role":"Cihan Albora","photo":"/uWddtN58lK4QjmfaMIW8smLXfr8.jpg"},{"name":"Sinem Ünsal","role":"Alya Smith Albora","photo":"/z7LF1TP34VGJiL3bwxNHJHRCPQE.jpg"},{"name":"Gonca Cilasun","role":"Sadakat Albora","photo":"/99kch2UqLzdgavqJThOwsCOoQCL.jpg"},{"name":"Müfit Kayacan","role":"Ecmel Albora","photo":"/2QVDWWQj45uOgnD2DUkB1tC5LWt.jpg"},{"name":"Atakan Özkaya","role":"Kaya Albora","photo":"/sZReWf4GrHUsPWfTmRZcYLOl5Ti.jpg"},{"name":"Sahra Şaş","role":"Nare Albora","photo":"/eIjDG6qNMZD1GirmE6vdl4vXODr.jpg"},{"name